<-- Counter demo

   Demonstrates numeric values flowing through |str| → |print|.
   Also shows that multiple independent gyges can be declared
   and chained without interference.

   Expected output:
       Items counted: 7
-->

::header::
    <o-> "counter"
    $S := spring

::body::
    |count|  := 7
    |label|  := "Items counted: "
    |count|  -> |str| -> |print|
